# The memory watch's timer (SPEC-031 R5; ADR-031): every minute, as the observability pack's watch
# timer runs it, with a short random delay so it never fires in step with the other timers. The
# calendar is written in UTC; a minute is the same span in every zone. With no Unit=, the timer
# starts the service of its own name.
[Unit]
Description=DeckStreak's memory watch, every minute
X-DurableServices-Waive=calendar-not-persistent a run missed while the host was down has nothing to catch up, since the restart made every cgroup anew and the next run a minute later reads them all

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:*:00 UTC
RandomizedDelaySec=20s
AccuracySec=1us

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
